<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2087_7827.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unnßer</unclear> fründtlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear> sampt was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> guots vermögend zuovor. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear>, fürsichtig, ehr=
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sam</unclear>, wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> fründ, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb
<lb n="4"/>nachparn.
<lb n="5"/>Es ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> dato vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> erschinen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gweßner</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">landtman</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Häinj</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zeller</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gepürtig</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-65" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Herisouw</unclear></placeName>, unnd
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> fürbringen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Demnach</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inne</unclear> uff üwer
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bleichj</unclear> zuo einem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bleichj</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meister</unclear> angenomen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Were</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>er von den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jenigen</unclear>. Die ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solhs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mißgonend</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gröblich</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gescholten</unclear> worden. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiruff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">flißig</unclear> gepetten.
<lb n="11"/>Wir woltend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">synes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verhaltens</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halber</unclear>, so lang
<lb n="12"/>er in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnßerem</unclear> land <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewohnet</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrifftlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schyn</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>günstig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mittheillen</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obwoll</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dißem</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> fürgenomen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Diewill</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syne</unclear> religion. unnd
<lb n="15"/>landtrecht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verzogen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nützet</unclear> mehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuobeladen</unclear>.
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Habend</unclear> wir jedoch uff syn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">villfaltig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anhalten</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="17"/>pitten. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> nicht versagen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deßweg=</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> wir üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuozuoßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuegend</unclear>. Das
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgeloßenen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jahren</unclear>. er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verklagt</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/>das er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lüthen</unclear>. by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nächtlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inzuobrechen</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/>understanden. unnd das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstollen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habe</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wie</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrliche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lüth</unclear>. so zum theill noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>leben. mit dem eyd bezüget <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habend</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hiruff</unclear> wir
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfengklich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ynzjechen</unclear>, unnd allem ernst nach
<lb n="25"/>examinieren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>. Hat er doch an der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marter</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2087_7828.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/>erhalten. Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßhalben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unrecht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschehen</unclear>,
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syge</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alleinig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekendt</unclear>. Das er gredt wann
<lb n="28"/>unsser Herrgott. syn muetter so noch lebt, unnd
<lb n="29"/>synen vetter <persName resp="#ner">Joß Ramsouwer</persName>. sälligen neme.
<lb n="30"/>so neme er dem Tüffel das syn. Welliches ime
<lb n="31"/>doch hötzlich grüewen syge. Sonsten ist er woll
<lb n="32"/>etliche mahl gröblich gescholten worden. Welliches
<lb n="33"/>er aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungerecht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fertiget</unclear> uff ime ersizen lassen.
<lb n="34"/>Diß woltend wir iuw uff ihr vilfaltig pitten hin.
<lb n="35"/>unangefüegt nicht lassen. Verblibend üch sonsten
<lb n="36"/>zueerwyßung nachpürlicher diensten woll geneigt,
<lb n="37"/>damit göttlichen gnaden befelchende. Date
<lb n="38"/><origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-263" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Trogen</origPlace> <origDate when="1618" resp="#ner">den. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">4</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">te</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martii</unclear> anno 1618</origDate>.
<lb n="39"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-773" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Lanndtaman und rath der usseren
<lb n="40"/>Roden deß lanndts Appenzell</orgName>.
